| Ed301-EdDSA-v1 | expand | 27,807 | 1,098 | 27,330–30,911 |
| Ed301-EdDSA-v2 | expand | 27,462 | 2,080 | 27,202–33,540 |
| Ed301-EdDSA-v1 | sign | 28,560 | 0,219 | 28,319–29,073 |
